Capability sentinel for the desired-state-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/desired-state
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises the Atlas desired-state source model
Ptah implements for `schema diff`, `schema apply`, and `migrate diff`
(stokaro/ptah#811, stokaro/ptah#842): live database URLs, an atlas.sum-covered
migration directory replayed on a dev database, env:// references resolved
through an evaluated atlas.hcl environment, migrate-diff convergence, and
desired/dev alias rejection before source mutation or artifact creation. All
databases are ephemeral SQLite files in the scratch run directory.
